[h1] Grid Element Test Page

[p] This page tests all supported element types inside a [grid] container.

[h2] Two columns - paragraphs with alignment

[grid- columns=auto;auto]

[p align=left] Left aligned text in column one. This wraps if long enough.
[p align=right] Right aligned text in column two. Also wraps if needed.

[-grid]

[h2] Three columns - plain paragraphs (table-like)

[grid- columns=100;60;auto]

[p] Name
[p] Date
[p] Comment

[p] saturn91
[p] 01/01/1970
[p] Saturn91 pretends to be born in this galaxy.

[p] John Doe
[p] 15/03/1985
[p] Nothing special happened that day.

[-grid]

[h2] Two columns - multiline paragraphs

[grid- columns=auto;auto]

[p-]
The left column can hold a longer block of text. It wraps to fit inside the column width and keeps going until the paragraph ends.
[-p]

[p-]
The right column holds another block of text, independent of the left. Both columns share the same row height automatically.
[-p]

[-grid]

[h2] Two columns - headings

[grid- columns=auto;auto]

[h1] Big Title
[h2] Subtitle Here

[h3] Small heading left
[h3] Small heading right

[-grid]

[h2] Three columns - headings with alignment

[grid- columns=auto;auto;auto]

[h2 align=left] Left
[h2 align=center] Center
[h2 align=right] Right

[-grid]

[h2] Two columns - links

[grid- columns=auto;auto]

[link file=index.podweb] Go to home
[link file=roadmap.podweb] View roadmap

[-grid]

[h2] Two columns - images

[grid- columns=auto;auto]

[img url=podnet://48932/404.gfx align=center]
[img url=podnet://48932/404.gfx align=center]

[-grid]

[h2] Sidebar layout - image + text

[grid- columns=80;auto]

[img url=podnet://48932/404.gfx align=left]

[p-]
This text sits beside the image in the right column. It acts like a caption or sidebar description. The image column is fixed at 80px and the text fills the rest.
[-p]

[-grid]

[h2] Two columns - code blocks

[grid- columns=auto;auto]

[code-]
-- left column code
x = 10
y = 20
[-code]

[code-]
-- right column code
a = x + y
print(a)
[-code]

[-grid]

[h2] Fixed + auto column

[grid- columns=120;auto]

[p] Fixed 120px column with left text.
[p align=right] Auto-width column with right-aligned text.

[-grid]

[link file=index.podweb] back to home
